# ================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages redirects & SPA fallback.
#
# Rules are evaluated TOP-DOWN and the first match wins, so the
# permanent redirects MUST come before the catch-all fallback.
# ================================================================

# ----- Legacy v2 URLs → v3 ---------------------------------------
# v2 served /certification (and /certification/…) — v3 calls the page
# /certificates. Without these, every inbound link and Google result
# for the old URL would land on the 404 route.
/certification        /certificates   301
/certification/       /certificates   301
/certification/*      /certificates   301

# ----- SPA fallback ----------------------------------------------
# Route-specific HTML shells are generated at build time for SEO, so
# /projects, /career, … resolve to real files first; this catches
# everything else (unknown deep links) and lets the router render 404.
/* /index.html 200
